            "title": "Example: No own condition",
            "id": 84577,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat pernyataan <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> yang menampilkan apakah pengguna mendapatkan angka 3 atau tidak saat melempar dadu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"rolled = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rolled == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have rolled a 3.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You haven't rolled a 3.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You haven't rolled a 3.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>if</code>, diikuti oleh <code>rolled == 3</code>, lalu <code>else</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
